      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd be ecstatic if this was a thing. I'm really sick of being on orange all the time but I feel like I have to because I don't always want every single person on my friends list to join me. It's unrealistic to expect all friend groups to mesh well together (like real life) and I don't like that I can't host an instance on green without worrying about how two very different people will interact.\n\nBeing able to 'code switch' between different friends so easily is such a big part of why I love socializing in VRChat, but I feel like I can't be as social as I'd like to be because I'm never the one hosting instances on green. \n\nI think a similar post by Pphoenix666 (https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/green-only-for-favorite-friends) has the right idea for how this would work in practice.\n\nYou should be able to optionally appear as 'green' to the favourites playlists you choose and 'orange' to others.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
